{"args":["--project","issue-viewer","comment","workflow/local-ci-validate-integrated-main-after-every-merge-and-report-failures","tests: make validate green at 5c5f6b1 (go vet; go test ./... -count=1 all packages ok, incl. new internal/ci; cmd/issue-cli coverage 84.9%; 26 playtest sessions / 111 steps valid). make ux-test ISSUE=\u003cslug\u003e REPEAT=2: TP4-TP7 pass, run 2 matches run 1. Regression sessions status-page, workboard-markers, system-pages pass. Sandbox (.agent-logs/ci-sandbox) exercised end to end: viewer watcher → detached tmux run green; land-red → red within one poll with ci: comment, Status card, status.md; viewer restart caught up on a head landed while down; ci watch --once without the viewer; slow tier on request. No unrelated failures."],"pid":3801277,"ppid":3801276,"ts":"2026-10-22T15:33:43Z"}
