{"args":["--project","issue-viewer","comment","workflow/local-ci-validate-integrated-main-after-every-merge-and-report-failures","--text","playtest: TP5 FAIL (owner, local-ci): (owner passed it, but machine check failed: text_equals {target=status.ci.state, text=red}, actual green) (owner passed it, but machine check failed: text_contains {target=status.ci.line, text=TestRoutePlanner}, actual main green at bb47fba (9s ago)) (owner passed it, but machine check failed: text_contains {target=status.ci.failed, text=TestRoutePlanner}, actual missing) (owner passed it, but machine check failed: text_contains {target=status.ci.blamed, text=Route planner panel}, actual missing) (owner passed it, but machine check failed: visible status.ci.log, actual missing) (owner passed it, but machine check failed: visible status.waiting.ci, actual missing) (owner passed it, but machine check failed: text_equals {target=status.waiting.count, text=1}, actual 0) (owner passed it, but machine check failed: text_equals {target=nav.tab.status.count, text=1}, actual missing) (owner passed it, but machine check failed: issue {comment_contains=ci: local CI red on main, slug=ui/route-planner-panel}, actual 0 comments: ) (owner passed it, but machine check failed: http {contains=## Waiting on you (1)\n- Local CI red on main since, path=/p/{project}/status.md}, actual 200 # Orbit status, 2026-10-22 18:26\n\n## Where we are\n- All issues: 1/2 done (no versions set)\n- Local CI: main green at bb47fba (18s ago)\n\n## Recently shipped\n- Nothing in the last 7 days\n\n## Working on\nLead: lead-orbit (not running)\n- [in progress ≈49d] ui/offline-map-tiles (agent stopped)\n\n## Next\n…)"],"pid":914510,"ppid":914477,"ts":"2026-10-22T18:38:26Z"}
